$DATUM Novel Synthetic Route to Fluoxetine
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):AUTHOR
$DATUM Schulze, Matthias
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Synthetic Communications (2010), 40(22), 3415-3422

