$DATUM Ethyl N-(1,3-diphenyl-1H-thieno[2,3-c]pyrazol-5-yl)carbamate (22)
Compound 20 (0.69 g, 0.002 mol) was heated under reflux in ethanol (20
ml) for 2 hrs. The reaction mixture was then concentrated and left to
cool. The crystalline solid product was collected and recrystallized from
ethanol as pale yellow needles, yield 65%. Ethyl
N-(1,3-diphenyl-1H-thieno[2,3-c]pyrazol-5-yl)carbamate (22), yield 65%.
m.p. 170-71°C; IR: ν cm-1 3340, (NH) and 1705 (C=O). 1H NMR (CDCl3): δ
7.2-8.2 (m, 12H, Ar-H + NH + thiophene-H), 4.3 (q, 2H, CH2), 1.4 (t, 3H,
CH3). Anal. Calcd. for C20H17N3O2S: C, 66.10; H, 4.71; N, 11.56; S, 8.82.
Found: C, 66.26; H, 4.75; N, 11.81;S, 8.70.
