$DATUM Step 1: To a suspension of azide (2: 0.125 g, 0.109 mmol) in toluene (5
mL) was added the alcohol (0.053 g, 0.326 mmol) and the mixture was
stirred at 80 °C for 16 hours. The reaction was concentrated and the
crude product was purified by flash chromatography (EtOAc). 0.085 g
(0.0663 mmol, 53%) of the urethane.
