$DATUM Step 1: To a suspension of the azide (2: 0.610 g, 0.530 mmol) in toluene
(25 mL) was added cyclohexanol (0.274 g, 1.59 mmol) and the mixture was
stirred at 80 °C for 5 hours. The solvents were concentrated in vacuo and
the crude product was purified by flash chromatography (MeOH/DCM). 0.293
g (0.226 mmol, 43%) of the ester.
