$DATUM Step 1: To a suspension of the azide (2: 0.462 g, 0.402 mmol) in toluene
(18 mL) was added the alcohol (0.058 g, 0.446 mmol) and the mixture was
stirred at 80 °C for 5 hours. All solvents were removed in vacuo and the
crude product was purified by flash chromatography (MeOH / DCM). 0.193 g
(0.154 mmol, 38%) of the ester.
