$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step 1: To a suspension of the acylazide (2, 0.600 g, 0.522 mmol) in
toluene (20 mL) was added trans- 4-hydroxy-cyclohexanecarboxylic acid
ethyl ester (0.134 g, 0.778 mmol) and the mixture was stirred at 80 °C
for 5 h. The reaction was concentrated in vacuo and the crude product was
purified by flash chromatography (MeOH/DCM). 0.236 g (0.182 mmol, 35%) of
the ester.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Curtius rearrangement
