$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Step 1: To a suspension of the azide (2: 0.548 g, 0.477 mmol) in toluene
(20 mL) was added the alcohol (0.057 g, 0.438 mmol) and the mixture was
stirred at 80 °C for 16 hours. All solvents were concentrated in vacuo
and the crude product was purified by flash chromatography (MeOH/DCM).
0.160 g (0.128 mmol, 29%) of the intermediate ester.
