$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: the residue was dissolved in 15.0 ml of
toluene. The solution was refluxed for 30 min. Complete conversion of
acid azide (IR peak at 2145 cm-1) to isocyanate (IR peak at 2225 cm-1)
was confirmed, and toluene was removed in vacuo. The resulting
analytically pure isocyanate was used in the next step
