$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: General/Typical Procedure: Example 3 -
Preparation of C60 Isocyanate. C60 malonyl azide prepared according to
Example 2 (87 mg, 0.1 mmol) was heated at 80°C in dry toluene (100 mL)
for 3 hours. Toluene was removed. Example 7 - Preparation of C70
Isocyanate. Example 3 was repeated except C70 malonyl azide prepared
according to Example 6 was used. 1H-NMR (CDCl3), 300 MHz, ppm): 4.60 (q,
J = 7.1 Hz, 2H, CH2), 1.61 (t, J = 7.1 Hz, 3H, CH3) (Figure 6(a)).
MALDI-MS (m/z): 967 (M+H+). FT-IR (cm-1): 2241.6, 1732.0 (Figure 6(b)).
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):TITLE
$DATUM Novel fullerene cyclopropanation reaction
