2,3,4,5-tetrahydroxy-6-(7-methoxybenzo[d][1,3]dioxol-5-yl)cyclohexylcarbamate
24.: A mixture of 8 (52 mg, 0.15 mmol), Et3N (0.1 mL, 0.46 mmol) and DPPA
(0.1 mL, 0.46 mmol) in 2.0 mL of toluene was heated under reflux for 2 h.
The reaction mixture was then cooled to rt, diluted with EtOAc, washed
with sat. NH4Cl solution, brine, dried over Na2SO4, filtered,
concentrated and purified by flash column chromatography (100% EtOAc).
The corresponding isocyanate. FT-IR (CD3OD) 3376, 2924, 2854, 2170, 1743,
1489 cm-1.
