$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Isocyanatoferrocene Fc-NCO (2). A solution of ferrocenecarboxazide 1 (400
mg, 1.56 mmol) in dry benzene (20 mL) was heated to 85 °C for 4 h. After
cooling to 20 °C, the reaction mixture was evaporated in Vacuo to
dryness. This crude product was applied for the following coupling
reactions without further purification. Isocyanatoferrocene Fc-NCO (2).
IR (CH2Cl2): ν 2173 (s, NCO) cm-1.
